     {
         "title": "New Studio Ghibli anime gets extended run at the only cinema in Japan where it’s being shown",
         "description": "If you\u0026#8217;re planning a trip to Japan soon, you\u0026#8217;ll have a better chance of seeing A Night in the Valley of Witches. Studio Ghibli is world-famous for its feature-length anime movies, but what a lot of fans don’t know is that the studio has a roster of animated shorts that are just as captivating. These [\u0026#8230;]",
         "content": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-747980\" src=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?w=640\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"346\" srcset=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg 1920w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=150,81 150w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=640,346 640w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=768,416 768w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=1024,554 1024w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=1536,831 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: large\"\u003eIf you\u0026#8217;re planning a trip to Japan soon, you\u0026#8217;ll have a better chance of seeing A Night in the Valley of Witches.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan id=\"more-747674\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStudio Ghibli\u003c/strong\u003e is world-famous for its feature-length anime movies, but what a lot of fans don’t know is that \u003cstrong\u003ethe studio has a roster of animated shorts that are just as captivating\u003c/strong\u003e. These rare beauties are like hidden gems for Ghibli hunters, as they’re screened at just two places in the world — the \u003cstrong\u003eGhibli Museum in Tokyo\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eGhibli Park in Aichi Prefecture\u003c/strong\u003e. Making them even more of a rarity is the fact that the museum and park screen the shorts one at a time, with the line-up usually changing monthly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e▼ \u003cem\u003eMy Neighbour Totoro\u003c/em\u003e sequel \u003ca href=\"https://soranews24.com/2017/10/11/totoro-has-a-sequel-thousands-of-japanese-twitter-users-shocked-to-learn-of-ghibli-follow-up/\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eMei and the Kittenbus\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e is one such short film.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-747983\" src=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg?w=640\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"346\" srcset=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg 1920w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg?resize=150,81 150w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg?resize=640,346 640w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg?resize=768,415 768w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg?resize=1024,554 1024w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-5.jpeg?resize=1536,830 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, though, Ghibli Park is making an exception to the rule, by extending the screening period for the studio’s newest short, \u003cstrong\u003eA Night in the Valley of Witches\u003c/strong\u003e, which debuted at Cinema Orion inside Ghibli’s Grand Warehouse in July. The movie has been so well-received that the park now says it’s decided to extend the run right through to June 2027, giving fans more time to view this newest Ghibli gem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-747980\" src=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?w=640\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"346\" srcset=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg 1920w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=150,81 150w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=640,346 640w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=768,416 768w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=1024,554 1024w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-1.jpeg?resize=1536,831 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlthough this particular film is exclusive to Ghibli Park, there really is no better place in the world to see it, as the storyline is set in the park’s own \u003ca href=\"https://soranews24.com/2024/03/01/ghibli-park-opens-final-area-to-first-visitors-with-stunning-new-attractions-and-shops-%e3%80%90videos%e3%80%91/\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eValley of Witches area\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e▼ The area honours Ghibli\u0026#8217;s witchy characters with buildings like the bakery from \u003cstrong\u003eKiki\u0026#8217;s Delivery Service\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-747982\" src=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg?w=640\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg 1920w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg?resize=150,100 150w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg?resize=640,427 640w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg?resize=768,512 768w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg?resize=1024,683 1024w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-3.jpeg?resize=1536,1024 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccording to the synopsis, \u003cem\u003eA Night in the Valley of Witches\u003c/em\u003e follows the story of a new recruit at the park, who receives a surprising number of requests to repair numerous buildings on the grounds. While carrying out the repairs, a number of odd things occur – a fireplace comes alight on its own and water gushes spontaneously from the taps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThough he’s shaken by what’s going on, one of his senior colleagues, Kikue, dismisses his concerns, until one night at midnight, after the park closes, he heads to the Valley of Witches, where he finds Kikue clad in a cape. Kikue reveals herself to be a witch and then chants a spell, setting the stage for some mysterious magic…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-747981\" src=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-2.jpeg?w=640\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"905\" srcset=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-2.jpeg 955w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-2.jpeg?resize=106,150 106w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-2.jpeg?resize=640,905 640w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-2.jpeg?resize=768,1086 768w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Studio-Ghibli-Park-new-anime-Valley-of-Witches-movie-film-cinema-Goro-Miyazaki-travel-Aichi-news-2.jpeg?resize=724,1024 724w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Valley of the Witches being a real-life area of the park, watching the film in this setting is a real treat for fans, especially at Halloween, when there will be a \u003ca href=\"https://soranews24.com/2026/09/10/how-to-watch-studio-ghiblis-new-anime-in-japan-with-a-special-after-dark-outdoor-screening-for-halloween/\"\u003especial after-dark outdoor screening of the film within the area\u003c/a\u003e. Outside of the special Halloween event, which is a children-only affair, the screening will take place at Cinema Orion, which isn’t too far from the Valley of Witches, so you’ll still be immersed in the world of Ghibli while you watch it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe extended run is welcome news for Ghibli fans, because the additional time gives visitors more chance of catching the film while planning their trips. Ghibli Park tickets must be booked in advance, with reservations generally opening at 2 p.m. on the 10th of each month for visits two months later. Tickets are still expected to be in high demand, though, so you’ll want to book early to make sure you don’t miss the run, although our fingers are firmly crossed that they might consider extending it even further, to give even more fans the chance to see it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eRelated: \u003ca href=\"https://ghibli-park.jp/en/\"\u003eGhibli Park official website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cem\u003eSource: \u003ca href=\"https://ghibli-park.jp/en/info/info20261009.html\"\u003eGhibli Park\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\nFeatured image: \u003ca href=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000054.000094737.html\"\u003ePR Times\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\nInsert images: PR Times (\u003ca href=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000054.000094737.html\"\u003e1\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000033.000094737.html\"\u003e2\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000030.000094737.html\"\u003e3\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000051.000094737.html\"\u003e4\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e● Want to hear about SoraNews24\u0026#8217;s latest articles as soon as they\u0026#8217;re published? \u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/RocketNews24En\"\u003eFollow us on Facebook\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://twitter.com/RocketNews24En\"\u003eTwitter\u003c/a\u003e!\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n",
